     <target value="Audit reports from spot check audits show improvement in compliance."></target>
     <actual value="Ghana has improved compliance with IMO standards through the development of a Surveyors Manual  with guidelines, procedures, instructions, check lists etc. to assist the surveyors during inspections, surveys and audits in accordance to the IMO Conventions. In addition, GMA has formalised a Quality Unit to conduct audits and assess Recognised organisations in Ghana. GMA has completed a follow-up audit on the 2017 IMSAS audit and the Corrective Action Plan in early 2021. COVID-19 travel restrictions did not allow for DMA personnel to physically travel to Ghana, yet activities were carried out using virtual means. GMA has expressed satisfaction with the assistance of the DMA in these aspects, which has significantly increased IMO compliance and response to IMO follow-up auditors."></actual>
